  "description": "In the sweltering heat of summer, seven office workers lose their way during a company workshop. They stumble upon an old mountain lodge filled with mysterious, unidentified bottles of alcohol. As if bewitched, they drink one glass after another slowly letting their reason slipping away. The boss then discreetly offers us a proposal. The lodge suddenly fills with desire and secrets.\n\n*“Would you like to hear the story of my first experience?”*\n\n(Source: TOPTOON, translated)",
